[0m[0m
There are no [38;5;10m[features][0m in [38;5;10mCargo.toml[0m and no options in [38;5;10mCMakeLists.txt[0m, so there is exactly one configuration; [38;5;10mverify.sh[0m still enumerates feature subsets generically and runs everything in both the dev and release profiles.[0m[0m
