Tests load [3mboth[23m [38;5;10m.so[0m files through [38;5;10mlibloading[0m and call only exported symbols. Each call runs in a forked child so [38;5;10massert()[0m aborts and non-terminating loops are observable outcomes rather than harness deaths, and both buffers carry 64 KiB of slack because [38;5;10mcp_stored[0m memcpys its 16-bit [38;5;10mLEN[0m with no regard for [38;5;10mout_end[0m.[0m[0m
